<title>USA: Alaska $160 mln housing bonds free to trade.</title>
<headline>Alaska $160 mln housing bonds free to trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>ALASKA HOUSING FINANCE CORPORATION</p>
<p>RE: $159,870,602.70</p>
<p>MORTGAGE REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>1996 SERIES A</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price</p>
<p>restrictions are removed and the bonds are free to trade.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>George K. Baum &amp; Company</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
